<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 110 mln Dfl step-up bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 110 mln Dfl step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DFL   COUPON    *5.0 PCT   MATURITY    02.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.28    PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.705    SPREAD	1.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS RISING TO 6.375 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC   1.575</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED DSL 15.APR.03 AND 15.APR.04</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
